{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060540/block/singleImage/3249832/df/01M5Y5HD7XRGTE35BTVPR8MJ4T.jpg?updatedAt=1793087713\"/><figcaption>紅磡私家車掛經修改逾期殘疾泊車證，32歲男司機被捕。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (27 日 ) 上午 8 時 10 分，警方接獲途人報案，指發現一輛私家車停泊在紅磡民泰街，懷疑車上掛有虛假的泊車證明書。 人員接報到場，經初步調查，發現該私家車的泊車證明書已經逾期，懷疑其屆滿日期曾經被人修改，該名 32 歲姓劉男司機涉嫌「行使虛假文書」被捕，現正被扣留調查。據悉，有關文件為「司機接載行動不便的殘疾人士泊車證明書」，事發位置屬殘疾人士專用泊車位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:13.958717+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:55:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:15.412701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:27.393736+00:00","content_hash":"d0719bce082e1ff9f2cee103dc1c57016ebb962452bf6c838ca3488eb31948ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:13.958717+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}